{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"266e4ae2bfff5fbd7861de826d946d384ab489bcee6c4a5b21778f4b13c7a879","ja":"数日後。エミリーと麗花はまた、\nボーカルレッスンをしていて……","zh":"几天后。艾米莉和丽花又在\n进行声乐训练……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"382456b444da57a7e6add7211c2f856f7b89fb6ad5124fc4dc11b1638dd31424","ja":"わぁ～♪\nエミリーちゃん、今のすっごくよかったよ！","zh":"哇～♪\n艾米莉，刚才表现得太棒了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8c85398511e0bb04146bd1549acb16945d62d0c776135e4467d58de5c7ebd5f1","ja":"海美ちゃんのストレッチくらい、\nのびのび～って、歌えてたね♪","zh":"唱得就像海美做拉伸一样，\n舒展自如～呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"88c84199b99b4109229073bb3ac1cb0a78922ddbedd5deabc083c08268dd87f4","ja":"ありがとうございます！　麗花さんのおかげで、\n歌詞のことが、少しは理解できたように思います！","zh":"太感谢您了！多亏了丽花小姐，\n我感觉自己好像稍微理解了一些歌词！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ad0a4274d298ef7bf372d1766ff24c32266bd0edeb21a21cf752bb0310d79dce","ja":"先日、いろいろな場所に連れて行ってくださったのは、\nそのためだったんですよね。","zh":"前几天您带我去了各种地方，\n其实就是为了这个吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"c411cc5c3ce62fece8c71c0f0f57fea5b49f8c5e39a3ac47e6d97add1887e6cb","ja":"うんうん♪\nエミリーちゃんのお役に立てたのなら、うれしいな♪","zh":"嗯嗯♪\n能帮上艾米莉的忙，我就很高兴啦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"3985823203683b5b9736138ce7e9c3024afbff3aa5f4614ffa33a8abf815f7ea","ja":"ところでこの後、\nこの前行けなかったコスメのお店に行かない？","zh":"话说等下要不要去\n之前没去成的那家美妆店？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"da56fe3b61e270207b55485a03ed65e9320d19019272a7de0ab0687dc3fed7f4","ja":"はい、ご一緒させてください！","zh":"好的，请务必让我一起去！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"6407e2ee581c8308ccf760292a35dc68e47c951d9ca64308ebc317ec60deaa5e","ja":"るんるんる～ん♪\n楽しみだな～♪　……あっ！","zh":"啦啦啦～♪\n真让人期待啊～♪　……啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"f5688fd9893e2a38d2ce01ae8ff9dc18c1c4341c9e5cd47ce1127d504f3180f0","ja":"ねえねえ、エミリーちゃん！\nあっちに雑貨のお店があるよ、行ってみましょう♪","zh":"我说我说，艾米莉！\n那边有家杂货店呢，去看看吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"41f93be786719aa151e6ce59da22cc6fce3c15f04a56f1e69bbcd00538b52e57","ja":"えっ？　あの、お化粧品のお店は……。","zh":"咦？那个，化妆品店是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"ab9c4d4cdbbbe7479578c9809230bf16fb00befbf7580c6d98d7ba64a73a6e11","ja":"（はっ、もしかして、\nこれも私のためを思っての行動かも……？）","zh":"（啊，难道说，\n这也是为了我着想才这么做的……？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"298ef2831671c8377fa436e56342cee486bde2ce8bf0cff5f061b70b7338d0c1","ja":"は、はいっ！　ぜひ、お供させてください！","zh":"是、是的！请务必让我陪同您一起去！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1504.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"99e90667f884cf22ec083e65660167ee66db539a5ab0146033366a80bf7bbb80","ja":"よーし、それじゃあ、レッツゴー♪","zh":"好～，那就出发吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
